<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 23/24.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 23/24.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania  set on</p>
<p>the following currency fixings for Tuesday, June 24 on Monday.</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to</p>
<p>one.</p>
<p>		   24.06.97	  23.06.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.6120	    6.5812</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3134	    2.3188</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5272	    4.5358</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.4698	    3.4910</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5191	    0.5182</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7744	    0.7745</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2892	    0.2899</p>
<p>    LAT	  7.0120	    7.0108</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6946	    0.6943</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2339	    7.0108</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
